  ('Double Dumbbell Suitcase Split Squat', 'Holding a dumbbell in each hand, held down at your side like a suitcase, a stationary staggered-stance lower-body exercise -- builds single-leg strength and balance without the stepping motion of a lunge.', 'Take a split stance long enough that the front knee stays over the ankle at the bottom; lower straight down until both knees reach roughly 90 degrees; drive through the front foot to stand.'),
