  ('Dumbbell Goblet Squat', 'Using a dumbbell (or a pair), held at the chest in a goblet hold, a foundational bend-the-knees-and-hips pattern that builds lower-body strength through the quads, glutes, and core.', 'Feet shoulder-width, toes slightly out; sit the hips back and down while keeping the chest tall; knees track over the toes; drive through the whole foot to stand.'),
