  ('Slider Eccentric Hamstring Curl', 'Using sliders (or a towel/paper plate on a smooth floor), a hamstring isolation exercise that curls the heels toward the glutes.', 'Keep the hips pressed down and square throughout; curl the heels toward the glutes squeezing the hamstrings at the top; lower under control without letting the hips pike up.'),
