  ('Slider Knee Tuck', 'Using sliders (or a towel/paper plate on a smooth floor), a core exercise (often on sliders/rings) that draws the knees in toward the chest from a plank position.', 'Set up in a strong plank with feet on sliders or a wheel; draw both knees in toward the chest while keeping the hips level; extend back out under control.'),
